WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.604
One message out, every reply back.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.409
On Agents, filter to the ones you mean,

00:00:07.087 --> 00:00:09.130
select all three,

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:11.408
set the mode to Send,

00:00:11.609 --> 00:00:12.910
write the message once,

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:15.753
and send it to all three.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.030
Each card shows it was sent,

00:00:18.272 --> 00:00:21.374
As each agent answers, its reply appears,

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:23.955
until all three are in.
